==Battleground==
*6 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 1 second<sup>30f</sup>, delay 2~3 seconds<sup>60f~90f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 6~8 seconds<sup>180f~240f</sup>.
*1 [[One Horn]] spawns after 35.33 seconds<sup>1,060f</sup>.
*5 [[Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*5 [[Fireworks Guys (Low-Yield)]] spawn after 21.67 seconds<sup>650f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Maji Cat & Cat Tour Group (Enemy)|Maji Cat & Cat Tour Group]] spawns as the boss after 25.33 seconds<sup>760f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

